# logs.schema — who may set each key of the `logs` subsystem (see w-conf.md).
# Format: <KEY>\t<scope>   scope: system | user | both
#
# Log retention is machine-wide policy: one user must not shorten (or extend) how
# long the system keeps everyone's logs. Root domain, no user layer.
RETENTION_DAYS	system
MAX_SIZE	system
